    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d291-a1">

                <pb facs="0300" n="294" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg294"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Captain Watson to Mr. Baker.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Colon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-05-03T20:15:00-05:19">8.15 <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >p.m</hi>., <hi rendition="#italic">May 3, 1894.</hi></date><lb/><hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Managua</hi>, 10 <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >p.m</hi>., <hi rendition="#italic">May 3,
                    1894.</hi></dateline></opener>
                <p>Have copies instructions sent you, dated May 12 and 24, concerning demands in
                    Argüello case. Ready to assist with all my force. <hi rendition="#italic">New
                        York</hi> goes home on our return Bluefields unless emergency forbids. Cable
                    me situation.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
